sequenceDiagram
    %% SD1 - Enroll a camper
    %% Stories: 15, 16, 24, 39, 46, 47
    %% Description: A parent creates an account or is added by the camp administrator, enrolls a camper and follows the enrollment. The administrator stores emergency and guardian information.
    actor PA as Parent
    actor AD as Camp administrator
    participant GD as Guardian
    participant CA as Camper
    participant CM as Camp

    %% covers 39
    PA->>GD: create account
    %% covers 24
    AD->>GD: add parent
    %% covers 46
    PA->>GD: enroll camper
    GD->>CA: camper
    CA->>CM: camp
    %% covers 15, 16
    AD->>CA: store emergency and guardian information
    %% covers 47
    PA->>GD: view and edit enrolled campers
